From 84731029d6c572a3056e792e7380a71b39b794a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:04:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] build(deps): move react and @types/react to 19.x with
 react-dom; bump dev deps

master had react 18.3.1 / @types/react 18 next to react-dom 19 / @types/react-dom 19,
so npm ci failed with ERESOLVE and react/react-dom would throw a version
mismatch at runtime. Also postcss 8.5.30, vitest 5.0.5, user-event 14.6.8, jsdom 30.1.3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AcRWToNeMR3FSJbaVE45MG
